    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/36f3c029c5e5a343ff0528fd5bdba688.avif?t=1749914297\" data-has-big width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant future, scientists of WHITE, are racing against time to prevent the destruction of their environment. In their quest for a new source of clean energy, they created a paradigital ecosystem capable of producing vast amounts of energy for the real world. However, mysterious entities are creating disruptions in the energy production. As a worker for WHITE energy solutions you descend into the cybernated environment to reactivate their facilities and eliminate the cause of the interferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHITE: ANASTASIS</strong> invites you into a captivating first-person, open-world adventure set within a beautifully crafted digital ecosystem. As a member of the WHITE Corporation, you'll dive into the Paraverse to fix malfunctioning energy facilities, face off against mysterious entities, and unravel the secrets that threaten both the digital and real worlds. Get ready for thrilling combat, tackle complex puzzles, and document your findings as you work to revive a crumbling reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/3c8c25e3bdeb78bd5f35c3af30222749.avif?t=1749914297\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a digital world like nothing you have seen before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/e35b99f32b44dd5d60e3fc4aa1f080a9.poster.avif?t=1749914297\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/e35b99f32b44dd5d60e3fc4aa1f080a9.webm?t=1749914297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/e35b99f32b44dd5d60e3fc4aa1f080a9.mp4?t=1749914297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/1ec1cf2c23fa9b6a52a4e1c9ee695f15.avif?t=1749914297\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare your tools and repair the destroyed facilities to restore life to the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/6926395a1ef8068a4e358fae93df89d4.poster.avif?t=1749914297\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/6926395a1ef8068a4e358fae93df89d4.webm?t=1749914297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/6926395a1ef8068a4e358fae93df89d4.mp4?t=1749914297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/5d4ebc9ea4784bc6fb97cba2ea0ea22e.avif?t=1749914297\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Paraverse is as beautiful as it is hostile! You will need to craft your weapons and upgrade your equipment in order to survive its unique enemy creatures and boss fights.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/d8565eb95cd81c73eff363ace1fb3183.poster.avif?t=1749914297\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/d8565eb95cd81c73eff363ace1fb3183.webm?t=1749914297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/d8565eb95cd81c73eff363ace1fb3183.mp4?t=1749914297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong><br><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/0d3fff28e870e244f21d15439769c206.avif?t=1749914297\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious entities will try to stop you from activating the energy facilities. Your skills and quick thinking will help you exterminate them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/7ee920c247c1b5beef56406b18b26302.poster.avif?t=1749914297\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/7ee920c247c1b5beef56406b18b26302.webm?t=1749914297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/7ee920c247c1b5beef56406b18b26302.mp4?t=1749914297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/b36202fcdd5a52077ab77ddf50e591d3.avif?t=1749914297\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey you will discover many quests that will require your wit, empathy and intuition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/72324fbd2fcb71a3112163fc5a2a2523.poster.avif?t=1749914297\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/72324fbd2fcb71a3112163fc5a2a2523.webm?t=1749914297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/72324fbd2fcb71a3112163fc5a2a2523.mp4?t=1749914297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/366f02cd31e6bdb397767e1866190438.avif?t=1749914297\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the history of WHITE: Anastasis in abandoned installations and the mysterious spaces in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/8f29a35a9471cb1e9dc907cb39e96f7a.poster.avif?t=1749914297\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/8f29a35a9471cb1e9dc907cb39e96f7a.webm?t=1749914297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><s