    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/36f3c029c5e5a343ff0528fd5bdba688.avif?t=1749914297\" data-has-big width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant future, scientists of WHITE, are racing against time to prevent the destruction of their environment. In their quest for a new source of clean energy, they created a paradigital ecosystem capable of producing vast amounts of energy for the real world. However, mysterious entities are creating disruptions in the energy production. As a worker for WHITE energy solutions you descend into the cybernated environment to reactivate their facilities and eliminate the cause of the interferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHITE: ANASTASIS</strong> invites you into a captivating first-person, open-world adventure set within a beautifully crafted digital ecosystem. As a member of the WHITE Corporation, you'll dive into the Paraverse to fix malfunctioning energy facilities, face off against mysterious entities, and unravel the secrets that threaten both the digital and real worlds. Get ready for thrilling combat, tackle complex puzzles, and document your findings as you work to revive a crumbling reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892870/extras/3c8c25e3bdeb78bd5f35c3af30222749.avif?t=1749914297\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a digital world like nothing you have seen before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><sp